                      (    forth6809.asm):03792         ; restoration contract holds (net 0 change across the JSR CATCH,
                      (    forth6809.asm):03793         ; xt's slot effectively replaced by the throw code). Per CATCH's
                      (    forth6809.asm):03794         ; own spec, the i*x arguments' VALUES are explicitly unspecified
                      (    forth6809.asm):03795         ; after a catch, not just untested here - the final, unconditional
                      (    forth6809.asm):03796         ; stack restore discards them without needing to know how many
                      (    forth6809.asm):03797         ; there are.
