                      (    forth6809.asm):06399         ; via ELSE's own unconditional branch. Verified by hand-trace:
                      (    forth6809.asm):06400         ; IF's patched offset (12) lands exactly at the ELSE-body's
                      (    forth6809.asm):06401         ; start; ELSE's own patched offset (7) lands exactly past it.
