                      (    forth6809.asm):07635         ; immediately without ever touching CODEHERE - the error path
                      (    forth6809.asm):07636         ; never reaches any compiling code - so this needs no CODEHERE
                      (    forth6809.asm):07637         ; redirect, unlike every other test in this section. Same
                      (    forth6809.asm):07638         ; CATCH-based pattern as the divide-by-zero tests in earlier
                      (    forth6809.asm):07639         ; sections: verify the thrown code and CATCH's own depth-
                      (    forth6809.asm):07640         ; restoration contract, not the unspecified i*x values.
