                      (    forth6809.asm):08594         ; is even parsed - confirmed by reading BUFFERCOLON's own code,
                      (    forth6809.asm):08595         ; which pops u as its very first action, before calling HEADER),
                      (    forth6809.asm):08596         ; then executes the result. Verifies it pushes its own PFA
                      (    forth6809.asm):08597         ; address (matching VARIABLE's own DOESRT0 behavior - BUFFER:
                      (    forth6809.asm):08598         ; shares it) and that VARHERE genuinely advanced by exactly the
                      (    forth6809.asm):08599         ; requested 10 bytes - not just that some space was reserved.
                      (    forth6809.asm):08600         ; Contents are documented uninitialized, so not checked.
                      (    forth6809.asm):08601         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
