                      (    forth6809.asm):10721         ; message ("HI"), executes with a false flag, and verifies
                      (    forth6809.asm):10722         ; execution genuinely resumes right after the embedded message
                      (    forth6809.asm):10723         ; text - confirmed by hand-tracing DOABORTQUOTE's own code: on
                      (    forth6809.asm):10724         ; false, it skips past the inline message and returns normally,
                      (    forth6809.asm):10725         ; matching its own documented "on false flag: does nothing
                      (    forth6809.asm):10726         ; further".
                      (    forth6809.asm):10727         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
