                      (    forth6809.asm):13063                     BNE  SR1FAIL
                      (    forth6809.asm):13064                     PULU D
                      (    forth6809.asm):13065                     CMPD #3
                      (    forth6809.asm):13066                     BNE  SR1FAIL
