                      (    forth6809.asm):15314         ; TSTHANDLERSAVE - unit test verifying CATCH correctly restores
                      (    forth6809.asm):15315         ; HANDLER afterward, on both paths - the success path (wrapping
                      (    forth6809.asm):15316         ; DUP) and the throw path (wrapping TSTTHROWHLP again). Confirms
                      (    forth6809.asm):15317         ; the documented "restores... HANDLER on either path" directly,
                      (    forth6809.asm):15318         ; by reading HANDLER itself before and after each call, rather
                      (    forth6809.asm):15319         ; than only inferring it from the stack-level behavior CATCH's
                      (    forth6809.asm):15320         ; other tests already cover.
