                      (    forth6809.asm):15424         ; Comments test harness (glossary section 3.16). Both words
                      (    forth6809.asm):15425         ; parse from source, so both redirect SRCADDR/SRCLEN/TOIN,
                      (    forth6809.asm):15426         ; matching the established pattern from sections 3.8-3.12.
                      (    forth6809.asm):15427         ;
                      (    forth6809.asm):15428         ; ( specifically carries real bug-fix history worth verifying
                      (    forth6809.asm):15429         ; directly, not just noting: a prior version omitted consuming
                      (    forth6809.asm):15430         ; WORD's own returned c-addr, leaving a stray value on the data
                      (    forth6809.asm):15431         ; stack after every "(...)" comment - confirmed via MAME at the
                      (    forth6809.asm):15432         ; time, symptomatic both as a visible stray value in interpret
                      (    forth6809.asm):15433         ; mode and as a -22 CSP mismatch for any colon definition
                      (    forth6809.asm):15434         ; containing one. This section's own test specifically confirms
                      (    forth6809.asm):15435         ; the data stack is genuinely unchanged (net 0), not just that
                      (    forth6809.asm):15436         ; parsing advanced correctly.
                      (    forth6809.asm):15437         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
