                      (    forth6809.asm):16727         ; H_ABORT and H_QUIT are hand-built, not produced by the same
                      (    forth6809.asm):16728         ; generation pass as the 217 entries above - ABORT and QUIT need
                      (    forth6809.asm):16729         ; to be findable at the prompt, but HEADER/CREATE couldn't be used
                      (    forth6809.asm):16730         ; directly for these two (see the source conversation this file
