                      (    forth6809.asm):16980                                   ; COLON (sets STATE=-1) and SEMI (sets
                      (    forth6809.asm):16981                                   ; STATE=0, after checking CSP) are the
                      (    forth6809.asm):16982                                   ; correct, sole places STATE should change
