                      (    forth6809.asm):18050                                      ; when there's no carry - the complemented
                      (    forth6809.asm):18051                                      ; value was computed in D but never
                      (    forth6809.asm):18052                                      ; actually stored back to UDHI in that
                      (    forth6809.asm):18053                                      ; case, leaving it at its stale, pre-
                      (    forth6809.asm):18054                                      ; negation value. Masked by the carry bug
                      (    forth6809.asm):18055                                      ; above in practice (that bug meant carry
                      (    forth6809.asm):18056                                      ; was always seen as set, so this branch
                      (    forth6809.asm):18057                                      ; was never actually taken, and STD UDHI
                      (    forth6809.asm):18058                                      ; always ran) - fixing the carry check
                      (    forth6809.asm):18059                                      ; alone would have made this second,
                      (    forth6809.asm):18060                                      ; previously-latent bug live. Now branches
                      (    forth6809.asm):18061                                      ; only past the "+1", never past the
                      (    forth6809.asm):18062                                      ; store itself - the store always runs,
                      (    forth6809.asm):18063                                      ; either way.
