F894 93AB             (    forth6809.asm):20889                    SUBD UEDST     ; overwriting whatever was left on top of
F896 DDAD             (    forth6809.asm):20890                    STD  UEOUTLEN  ; the stack rather than pushing both
                      (    forth6809.asm):20891                                   ; required return values, and separately,
                      (    forth6809.asm):20892                                   ; UEOUTLEN itself was never correctly
                      (    forth6809.asm):20893                                   ; tracked by the old backslash-decoding
                      (    forth6809.asm):20894                                   ; loop's own per-character bookkeeping in a
                      (    forth6809.asm):20895                                   ; way that accounted for doubled '%'
