                      (    forth6809.asm):21583                                     ; read the "value" field from inside the
                      (    forth6809.asm):21584                                     ; NEXT entry's own string text instead of
                      (    forth6809.asm):21585                                     ; the real value. Confirmed via MAME: this
                      (    forth6809.asm):21586                                     ; exact mechanism produces $4E4D precisely
                      (    forth6809.asm):21587                                     ; - the bytes 'N' ($4E) and 'M' ($4D, the
                      (    forth6809.asm):21588                                     ; start of "MAX-U") sitting 4 bytes into
