                      (    forth6809.asm):21687                                      ; entirely (the top-of-file note calling
                      (    forth6809.asm):21688                                      ; out "/HOLD and /PAD... remain explicitly
                      (    forth6809.asm):21689                                      ; incomplete/absent" was accurate at the
                      (    forth6809.asm):21690                                      ; time). Answers HOLDMINSIZE (34), not the
