                      (    forth6809.asm):21692                                      ; specifically the portion of the
                      (    forth6809.asm):21693                                      ; CODEHERE-to-PAD gap reserved for the
                      (    forth6809.asm):21694                                      ; pictured numeric output buffer, the same
